{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":115,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܠܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܠܵܐ ܠܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂ ܗܲܒ݂ܠܔ ܐܝܼܩܵܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂، ܒܘܼܬ ܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܐܵܡܪܝܼ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܲܝܟܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܝܗ‌ܝ؟“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ ܒܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܔ ܕܒܵܣܡܵܐ ܠܹܗ ܟܹܐ ܥܵܒܹܕ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܵܢܲܡܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܣܹܐܡܵܐ ܘܕܲܗܒ݂ܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܵܐ ܕܐܝܼܕܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܕܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܘܼܡܵܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܗܲܡܙܸܡܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܝ̈ܢܹܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܚܵܙܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܵܬܝܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܫܵܡܥܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܵܚܝܼܪܵܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܫܵܩܠܝܼ ܪܹܝܚܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܕܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܪܵܓ݂ܫܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܩܠܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܚܵܕܪܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܦܲܠܛܝܼ ܩܵܠܵܐ ܒܒܵܠܘܿܥܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܕܝܼܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܒܸܬ ܗܵܘܝܼ ܬܲܪ̈ܨܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܠܔ ܕܣܵܒܹܪ ܒܝܼܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ، ܣܒܘܿܪ ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܝܲܪܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܘܡܵܛܵܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܒܹܝܬ ܐܲܗܪܘܿܢ، ܣܒܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܝܲܪܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܘܡܵܛܵܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܙܕܝܼ̈ܥܹܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܣܒܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܝܲܪܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܘܡܵܛܵܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܩܵܡ ܕܵܟܹܪܲܢ؛ ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܒܹܝܬ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܒܹܝܬ ܐܲܗܪܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܙܕܝܼ̈ܥܹܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܥܘܿܪܹ̈ܐ ܥܲܡ ܓܘܼܪܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܙܝܸܕ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܥܲܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܘܥܲܠܔ ܒܢܘܿܢܵܘ̈ܟ݂ܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܪܝܼܟܹܐ ܝܬܘܿܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܘܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܡܲܝܹ̈ܐ، ܫܡܲܝܹ̈ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܝܘܼܗܒܹܠܔ ܠܹܗ ܠܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܝܼ̈ܬܹ‌ܐ ܠܹܐ ܫܲܒܚܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܦܠܵܐ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܨܵܠܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܠܫܸܬܩܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܚܢܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܟܲܚ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܐܵܕܝܼܵܐ ܘܗܲܠܔ ܥܵܠܲܡ. ܗܲܠܸܠܘܼܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/115.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/116.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/114.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}